9, 3962, 16353, 13, 50760], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12314771105359484, "compression_ratio": 1.6045016077170418, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028130942955613136}, {"id": 31, "seek": 13554, "start": 143.45999999999998, "end": 148.66, "text": " Ahora adentr\u00e9monos en el edificio para analizar con detalle la genialidad de Gaud\u00ed, que logra", "tokens": [50760, 18840, 614, 317, 81, 18039, 329, 465, 806, 1257, 1089, 1004, 1690, 2624, 9736, 416, 1141, 11780, 635, 48228, 4580, 368, 460, 3751, 870, 11, 631, 3565, 424, 51020], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12314771105359484, "compression_ratio": 1.6045016077170418, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028130942955613136}, {"id": 32, "seek": 13554, "start": 148.66, "end": 154.94, "text": " reunir un dise\u00f1o peculiar y \u00fanico sin perder de vista la funcionalidad y eficiencia energ\u00e9tica.", "tokens": [51020, 14480, 347, 517, 3814, 7716, 27149, 288, 26113, 3343, 26971, 368, 22553, 635, 1019, 42395, 4580, 288, 49510, 30592, 10575, 37272, 13, 51334], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12314771105359484, "compression_ratio": 1.6045016077170418, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028130942955613136}, {"id": 33, "seek": 13554, "start": 154.94, "end": 158.98, "text": " Este tour inmersivo, m\u00e1s que un tour, es una experiencia multidimensional en la que", "tokens": [51334, 16105, 3512, 294, 18552, 6340, 11, 3573, 631, 517, 3512, 11, 785, 2002, 36489, 2120, 327, 332, 11075, 465, 635, 631, 51536], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12314771105359484, "compression_ratio": 1.6045016077170418, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028130942955613136}, {"id": 34, "seek": 13554, "start": 158.98, "end": 163.29999999999998, "text": " nos sumergiremos en la mente de Antoni Gaud\u00ed a trav\u00e9s de la realidad virtual, sonidos", "tokens": [51536, 3269, 2408, 17025, 621, 3415, 465, 635, 26577, 368, 15291, 72, 460, 3751, 870, 257, 24463, 368, 635, 25635, 6374, 11, 1872, 7895, 51752], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12314771105359484, "compression_ratio": 1.6045016077170418, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028130942955613136}, {"id": 35, "seek": 16330, "start": 163.42000000000002, "end": 169.10000000000002, "text": " dimensionales, intervenciones olfativas, texturas que invitan a ser acariciadas, as\u00ed como arte", "tokens": [50370, 10139, 4229, 11, 17104, 23469, 2545, 69, 35725, 11, 2487, 12907, 631, 1048, 9670, 257, 816, 696, 289, 8787, 6872, 11, 8582, 2617, 29159, 50654], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1434193948157748, "compression_ratio": 1.696551724137931, "no_speech_prob": 0.10727529227733612}, {"id": 36, "seek": 16330, "start": 169.10000000000002, "end": 173.58, "text": " en movimiento con la plataforma giratoria que encontramos en la primera sala, en la que", "tokens": [50654, 465, 43180, 416, 635, 46243, 14703, 1639, 654, 631, 45049, 465, 635, 17382, 37596, 11, 465, 635, 631, 50878], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1434193948157748, "compression_ratio": 1.696551724137931, "no_speech_prob": 0.10727529227733612}, {"id": 37, "seek": 16330, "start": 173.58, "end": 179.02, "text": " nos trasladamos al origen de todo, un momento revelador en la infancia del genio.", "tokens": [50878, 3269, 22507, 9290, 2151, 419, 2349, 268, 368, 5149, 11, 517, 9333, 15262, 5409, 465, 635, 1536, 22862, 1103, 1049, 1004, 13, 51150], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1434193948157748, "compression_ratio": 1.696551724137931, "no_speech_prob": 0.10727529227733612}, {"id": 38, "seek": 16330, "start": 179.02, "end": 183.34, "text": " Si no te quieres perder ning\u00fan detalle, te recomiendo la visita de realidad aumentada,", "tokens": [51150, 4909, 572, 535, 29839, 26971, 30394, 1141, 11780, 11, 535, 23334, 7304, 635, 1452, 2786, 368, 25635, 17128, 1538, 11, 51366], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1434193948157748, "compression_ratio": 1.696551724137931, "no_speech_prob": 0.10727529227733612}, {"id": 39, "seek": 16330, "start": 183.34, "end": 188.62, "text": " en la que te facilitar\u00e1n una tablet con la que podr\u00e1s observar como la casa cobra vida.", "tokens": [51366, 465, 635, 631, 535, 10217, 3981, 7200, 2002, 14136, 416, 635, 631, 15305, 2490, 9951, 289, 2617, 635, 9022, 48790, 7644, 13, 51630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1434193948157748, "compression_ratio": 1.696551724137931, "no_speech_prob": 0.10727529227733612}, {"id": 40, "seek": 16330, "start": 188.62, "end": 191.22000000000003, "text": " Puedes reservarla pinchando arriba a la derecha.", "tokens": [51630, 430, 5827, 279, 16454, 34148, 14614, 1806, 28469, 257, 635, 15969, 4413, 13, 51760], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1434193948157748, "compression_ratio": 1.696551724137931, "no_speech_prob": 0.10727529227733612}, {"id": 41, "seek": 19122, "start": 191.26, "end": 195.7, "text": " A continuaci\u00f3n se accede al vest\u00edbulo, donde se encuentra la conserger\u00eda original", "tokens": [50366, 316, 2993, 3482, 369, 696, 29815, 419, 15814, 870, 12176, 78, 11, 10488, 369, 43274, 635, 1014, 260, 1321, 2686, 3380, 50588], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12148642032704454, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 0.003333816770464182}, {"id": 42, "seek": 19122, "start": 195.7, "end": 200.02, "text": " y los elementos inspirados en la naturaleza comienzan a hacerse notar, como por ejemplo", "tokens": [50588, 288, 1750, 35797, 17432, 4181, 465, 635, 40877, 2394, 395, 1053, 21238, 257, 6720, 405, 406, 289, 11, 2617, 1515, 13358, 50804], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12148642032704454, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 0.003333816770464182}, {"id": 43, "seek": 19122, "start": 200.02, "end": 204.62, "text": " las clarabollas con forma de caparaz\u00f3n de tortuga, la escalera de madera cuya baranda", "tokens": [50804, 2439, 6093, 455, 1833, 296, 416, 8366, 368, 1410, 289, 921, 1801, 368, 10806, 19364, 11, 635, 17871, 1663, 368, 5244, 1663, 2702, 3016, 2159, 5575, 51034], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12148642032704454, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 0.003333816770464182}, {"id": 44, "seek": 19122, "start": 204.62, "end": 209.78, "text": " simula el espinazo de un gran cet\u00e1ceo o el revestimiento de paredes y techos recreando", "tokens": [51034, 1034, 3780, 806, 7089, 259, 29722, 368, 517, 9370, 8603, 842, 384, 78, 277, 806, 3698, 377, 14007, 368, 280, 1642, 279, 288, 7553, 329, 14261, 1806, 51292], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12148642032704454, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 0.003333816770464182}, {"id": 45, "seek": 19122, "start": 209.78, "end": 213.02, "text": " la piel de un animal nuevamente.", "tokens": [51292, 635, 46065, 368, 517, 5496, 10412, 85, 3439, 13, 51454], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12148642032704454, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 0.003333816770464182}, {"id": 46, "seek": 19122, "start": 213.02, "end": 217.3, "text": " Ya en la planta noble, destaca la chimenea en forma de zeta del despacho del se\u00f1or", "tokens": [51454, 6080, 465, 635, 3709, 64, 20171, 11, 2677, 6628, 635, 18375, 1450, 64, 465, 8366, 368, 710, 7664, 1103, 4887, 46574, 1103, 22188, 51668], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12148642032704454, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 0.003333816770464182}, {"id": 47, "seek": 21730, "start": 218.22, "end": 222.58, "text": " y el sal\u00f3n principal de la casa con un gran ventanal que ofrece privilegiadas vistas al", "tokens": [50410, 288, 806, 1845, 1801, 9716, 368, 635, 9022, 416, 517, 9370, 6931, 29702, 631, 295, 44209, 8670, 7834, 6872, 371, 14858, 419, 50628], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10501893615722656, "compression_ratio": 1.5895522388059702, "no_speech_prob": 0.0665333941578865}, {"id": 48, "seek": 21730, "start": 222.58, "end": 228.78, "text": " paseo de gracia, as\u00ed como un techo muy peculiar cuyas ondulaciones aluden a la fuerza del", "tokens": [50628, 47125, 78, 368, 11625, 654, 11, 8582, 2617, 517, 535, 5738, 5323, 27149, 2702, 39472, 322, 49716, 9188, 419, 32940, 257, 635, 39730, 1103, 50938], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10501893615722656, "compression_ratio": 1.5895522388059702, "no_speech_prob": 0.0665333941578865}, {"id": 49, "seek": 21730, "start": 228.78, "end": 229.78, "text": " mar.", "tokens": [50938, 1849, 13, 50988], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10501893615722656, "compression_ratio": 1.5895522388059702, "no_speech_prob": 0.0665333941578865}, {"id": 50, "seek": 21730, "start": 229.78, "end": 234.18, "text": " La casa tambi\u00e9n dispone de un jard\u00edn interior que destaca por su pavimento y por las jardineras", "tokens": [50988, 2369, 9022, 6407, 4920, 546, 368, 517, 46153, 10973, 10636, 631, 2677, 6628, 1515, 459, 280, 706, 10030, 288, 1515, 2439, 46153, 4564, 296, 51208], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10501893615722656, "compression_ratio": 1.5895522388059702, "no_speech_prob": 0.0665333941578865}, {"id": 51, "seek": 21730, "start": 234.18, "end": 238.82000000000002, "text": " recubiertas de cer\u00e1mica y vidrio como elemento decorativo.", "tokens": [51208, 850, 836, 4859, 296, 368, 10146, 19524, 2262, 288, 7217, 6584, 2617, 47961, 7919, 18586, 13, 51440], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10501893615722656, "compression_ratio": 1.5895522388059702, "no_speech_prob": 0.0665333941578865}, {"id": 52, "seek": 21730, "start": 238.82000000000002, "end": 243.10000000000002, "text": " El patio de luces juega un gran papel, ya que es el encargado de distribuir el aire", "tokens": [51440, 2699, 42924, 368, 10438, 887, 27833, 3680, 517, 9370, 24710, 11, 2478, 631, 785, 806, 2058, 289, 30135, 368, 4400, 34498, 806, 42885, 51654], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10501893615722656, "compression_ratio": 1.5895522388059702, "no_speech_prob": 0.0665333941578865}, {"id": 53, "seek": 24310, "start": 243.1, "end": 247.85999999999999, "text": " y la luz natural a toda la casa, por ello los azulejos que lo revisten presentan una", "tokens": [50364, 288, 635, 20671, 3303, 257, 11687, 635, 9022, 11, 1515, 33549, 1750, 7883, 2271, 19136, 631, 450, 3698, 4821, 1974, 282, 2002, 50602], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10962762832641601, "compression_ratio": 1.7318840579710144, "no_speech_prob": 0.13898400962352753}, {"id": 54, "seek": 24310, "start": 247.85999999999999, "end": 252.74, "text": " degradaci\u00f3n de color, siendo m\u00e1s intensos los de la parte superior y m\u00e1s claros los", "tokens": [50602, 24740, 3482, 368, 2017, 11, 31423, 3573, 14056, 329, 1750, 368, 635, 6975, 13028, 288, 3573, 6093, 329, 1750, 50846], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10962762832641601, "compression_ratio": 1.7318840579710144, "no_speech_prob": 0.13898400962352753}, {"id": 55, "seek": 24310, "start": 252.74, "end": 257.74, "text": " inferiores, a la inversa que las ventanas, que son m\u00e1s peque\u00f1as arriba y a medida que", "tokens": [50846, 13596, 72, 2706, 11, 257, 635, 21378, 64, 631, 2439, 6931, 14292, 11, 631, 1872, 3573, 19132, 32448, 28469, 288, 257, 32984, 631, 51096], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10962762832641601, "compression_ratio": 1.7318840579710144, "no_speech_prob": 0.13898400962352753}, {"id": 56, "seek": 24310, "start": 257.74, "end": 261.26, "text": " vamos descendiendo, van aumentando su tama\u00f1o.", "tokens": [51096, 5295, 16333, 7304, 11, 3161, 17128, 1806, 459, 45342, 7716, 13, 51272], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10962762832641601, "compression_ratio": 1.7318840579710144, "no_speech_prob": 0.13898400962352753}, {"id": 57, "seek": 24310, "start": 261.26, "end": 265.02, "text": " Tambi\u00e9n relacionado con la ventilaci\u00f3n encontramos unas rendijas de madera m\u00f3viles", "tokens": [51272, 25682, 27189, 1573, 416, 635, 27498, 3482, 45049, 25405, 6125, 1718, 296, 368, 5244, 1663, 32515, 85, 4680, 51460], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10962762832641601, "compression_ratio": 1.7318840579710144, "no_speech_prob": 0.13898400962352753}, {"id": 58, "seek": 24310, "start": 265.02, "end": 270.82, "text": " que sirven para graduar la ventilaci\u00f3n y nos recuerdan a las branquias de los peces.", "tokens": [51460, 631, 4735, 553, 1690, 4138, 289, 635, 27498, 3482, 288, 3269, 39092, 10312, 257, 2439, 12029, 358, 4609, 368, 1750, 520, 887, 13, 51750], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10962762832641601, "compression_ratio": 1.7318840579710144, "no_speech_prob": 0.13898400962352753}, {"id": 59, "seek": 27082, "start": 270.82, "end": 275.3, "text": " Con la entrada Gold tambi\u00e9n podemos acceder al dormitorio de la familia donde disfrutamos", "tokens": [50364, 2656, 635, 37119, 6731, 6407, 12234, 696, 1232, 260, 419, 12521, 3029, 1004, 368, 635, 24050, 10488, 37114, 325, 2151, 50588], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11962160856827446, "compression_ratio": 1.6810035842293907, "no_speech_prob": 0.18978680670261383}, {"id": 60, "seek": 27082, "start": 275.3, "end": 279.78, "text": " de un poco de paz lejos de la masificaci\u00f3n que hay en el resto de salas.", "tokens": [50588, 368, 517, 10639, 368, 30032, 476, 19136, 368, 635, 2300, 40802, 631, 4842, 465, 806, 28247, 368, 1845, 296, 13, 50812], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11962160856827446, "compression_ratio": 1.6810035842293907, "no_speech_prob": 0.18978680670261383}, {"id": 61, "seek": 27082, "start": 279.78, "end": 284.7, "text": " Si eres de los que huyes de las hordas de turistas, tienes disponible una visita matinal", "tokens": [50812, 4909, 30065, 368, 1750, 631, 2137, 2346, 368, 2439, 276, 765, 296, 368, 3243, 14858, 11, 20716, 23311, 964, 2002, 1452, 2786, 3803, 2071, 51058], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11962160856827446, "compression_ratio": 1.6810035842293907, "no_speech_prob": 0.18978680670261383}, {"id": 62, "seek": 27082, "start": 284.7, "end": 287.38, "text": " antes de la hora oficial de apertura.", "tokens": [51058, 11014, 368, 635, 15098, 37189, 368, 22939, 2991, 13, 51192], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logp